@title: shop_boots
@context: The most expensive product, more than once, and the total adds up.
@tags: shop
@import: * from '../lib/env.hunt'

STEP 1: Open the shop
    NAVIGATE to 'Shop'
    VERIFY that the page is 'Shop'

STEP 2: Boots
    CLICK the 'Add to cart' button NEAR 'Snow Boots'
    VERIFY 'Cart total' field has value '89.99'

STEP 3: Boots again
    CLICK the 'Add to cart' button NEAR 'Snow Boots'
    VERIFY 'Cart total' field has value '179.98'

STEP 4: A plush
    CLICK the 'Add to cart' button NEAR 'Manul Plush'
    VERIFY 'Cart total' field has value '204.48'

STEP 5: A map
    CLICK the 'Add to cart' button NEAR 'Steppe Map'
    VERIFY 'Cart total' field has value '216.48'
    VERIFY that 'Cart: 4' is present

STEP 6: Edit a team member
    CLICK the 'Edit' button INSIDE 'Team' row with 'Ada Lovelace'
    VERIFY that 'Editing Ada Lovelace' is present

STEP 7: Boots a third time
    CLICK the 'Add to cart' button NEAR 'Snow Boots'
    VERIFY that 'Cart: 5' is present
    VERIFY 'Cart total' field has value '306.47'

DONE.
